ates microtubule dynamics and stability by interacting with microtubule plus-end tracking proteins, such as MAPRE1, to regulate microtubule growth along actin stress fibers (PubMed:24706950). Enhances ADORA2-mediated adenylyl cyclase activation by acting as a scaffold to recruit trimeric G protein complexes to ADORA2A (By similarity). Regulates ciliary orientation and performance in cells located in the airway (PubMed:30665704)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}